window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>They tricked me into a dark and unholy union.</b></p> <p>Three bastards in witch hats, leather pants, and iron masks. These supernatural stalkers have claimed me for their coven. They won't go away. These assholes will. not. leave.</p> <p>All because I fell for an urban legend: touch the Witch's Tree on a moonless night and discover magic.</p> <p>Wholesome magic like: kinky rituals, blood sacrifice, and jizz potions. Oh, and a forest god who eats people—while they're still alive and screaming.</p> <p>Send help, and I'll send cupcakes.</p> <p>The Witchwood Boys Are Trending <i>is a reverse harem/why-choose romance (meaning one woman with three men). It's a unique blend of cozy urban fantasy and dark horror, and while it starts spicy, it gets much, much spicier. Includes forced proximity tropes, grumpy-sunshine dynamics, and a main character with a banana slug tattoo. All characters are twenty-two or older.</i></p> <p><i>Contains mature content. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p> <p><i>Narrated in duet style.</i></p>"; 
